  Reject a proposal                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                        
         ╔═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
> reason ║ not this host_                                                                                              ║
         ╚═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
         optional, at most 300 characters; the submitter reads it with qhost proposal show                              
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                            ╔═ Reject a proposal ══════════════════════════════════════════╗                            
                            ║ ⚠ Reject proposal p-0005?                                    ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ The proposal is closed as rejected and nothing on the host   ║                            
                            ║ changes. The reason, if you give one, is shown to the        ║                            
                            ║ submitter.                                                   ║                            
                            ║ $ sudo qhost proposal reject p-0005 --reason 'not this host' ║                            
                            ║   --output json                                              ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ [ yes, with sudo ]  > cancel <                               ║                            
                            ║ y yes, with sudo  n/esc/enter cancel                         ║                            
                            ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝                            
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
